
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Task 1: Get all books
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Task 2: Get book by ISBN
GET {{baseUrl}}/isbn/1

### Task 3: Get books by author
GET {{baseUrl}}/author/Unknown

### Task 4: Get books by title
GET {{baseUrl}}/title/The Epic Of Gilgamesh

### Task 5: Get book reviews by ISBN
GET {{baseUrl}}/review/1

### Task 5 (negative): reviews for invalid ISBN
GET {{baseUrl}}/review/999

### Task 6: Register a new user
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "testuser1",
	"password": "testpass1"
}

### Task 6 (negative): Register same user again
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "testuser1",
	"password": "testpass1"
}

### Task 6 (negative): Missing username/password
POST {{baseUrl}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Task 7: Login as registered user
# Run this before Task 8/9 so the session cookie is stored.
POST {{baseUrl}}/customer/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"username": "testuser1",
	"password": "testpass1"
}

### Task 8: Add review
PUT {{baseUrl}}/customer/auth/review/1?review=Great%20book

### Task 8: Modify review by same user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/customer/auth/review/1?review=Updated%20review

### Verify Task 8 review was saved
GET {{baseUrl}}/review/1

### Task 9: Delete own review
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/customer/auth/review/1

### Verify Task 9 review was deleted
GET {{baseUrl}}/review/1

### Get async books
GET {{baseUrl}}/async/books


### Get async books by isbn
GET {{baseUrl}}/async/isbn/1


### Get async books by author
GET {{baseUrl}}/async/author/Unknown


### Get async books by title
GET {{baseUrl}}/async/title/The%20Epic%20Of%20Gilgamesh